- **`sync-timedb-archive-janitor-contract.mdc`** — scheduled/immediate enqueue + async execution.
- **`sync-timedb-db-before-archive-contract.mdc`** — raw delete still DB-gated in `DayRawRemovalCoordinator`.
- **`process-title-and-pool-labels.mdc`** — `set_daemon_thread_title("", script_name=..., role=...)` on discover and async worker threads.
